OL,3,GNEWSAWoman saved by vicar's CPR calls
OL,4,Afor more training
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who survived a cardiac arrest
OL,7,Fin Alderney is encouraging islanders to
OL,8,Flearn cardiopulmonary resuscitation
OL,9,F(CPR).
OL,11,FRestart a Heart week runs until Friday
OL,12,F16 October, with free events to give
OL,13,Fpeople the skills to help save a life.
OL,15,FFran Trathen collapsed with a cardiac
OL,16,Farrest in 2025, but local vicar
OL,17,FSamantha Martell fortunately knew what
OL,18,Fshe had to do to help. She was able to
OL,19,Fprovide lifesaving CPR and, once first
OL,20,Fresponders and ambulance crew arrived,
OL,21,Fthey were able to get Fran's heart
OL,22,Fbeating again.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
