OL,3,GNEWSAWoman saved by vicar's CPR calls
OL,4,Afor more training
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrathen said she felt strongly everyone
OL,7,Fshould learn it as it could be anyone
OL,8,F"who collapses next to you", adding: "I
OL,9,Fdon't think anyone should be without
OL,10,Fthose skills, even children."
